# 4. process.py — STATE MACHINE UTAMA

**File:** `motion/src/process.py` | **Baris:** 1785 | **Role:** UTAMA/SECOND/GOTO

## 4.1 Subscribers

```python
/robotis/open_cr/yaw              → yaw_heading (Int16 → yaw_fixed)
/robotis/open_cr/imu              → imu_orientation (Imu → fall detection)
/robotis/open_cr/button           → opencr_button2 (String → mode control)
/robotis/goal_joint_states        → present_joint_states (JointState → head pan/tilt)
DEWO/.../ball_state               → ball_state_status (BallState → FOUND/NOTFOUND)
DEWO/.../coordinate               → ball_coordinate (BallCoordinate → pos + size)
DEWO/.../goal_coordinate          → goal_coordinate (GoalCoordinate → goal pos)
DEWO/.../goal_state               → goal_state_status (GoalState → FOUND/NOTFOUND)
DEWO/MotionControl/pan_tilt_error → pan_tilt_error (Float32MultiArray → PID error)
DEWO/Communication/robotinfo      → RobotInfo_Callback (RobotInfo → multi-robot)
DEWO/Communication/from_udp_to_ros→ from_udp_to_ros (String → remote command)
DEWO/Odometry/position            → location_Callback (Pose2D → X,Y,W global)
DEWO/Odometry/goalangle           → goalangle_Callback (Float32 → heading goal)
DEWO/GameController/allstate      → GCState_Callback (GameControllerState → status)
```

## 4.2 Publishers

```python
/DEWO/MotionControl/yaw              # yaw_fixed2 termormalisasi
/DEWO/MotionControl/HeadPan          # Head pan angle
/DEWO/MotionControl/Command          # "start"/"stop"/"reset"
/DEWO/MotionControl/HeadScan         # Bool scan enable
/DEWO/MotionControl/HeadTilt         # Head tilt angle
