# 5. process_baru.py — STATE MACHINE VERSI BARU

**File:** `motion/src/process_baru.py` | **Baris:** 1265

## 5.1 Perbedaan dari process.py

| Aspek | process.py | process_baru.py |
|---|---|---|
| Role system | UTAMA/SECOND/GOTO (Com_decision) | Single robot (tanpa multi-role) |
| Ball topic | `/DEWO/.../coordinate` | `/v9_ball_detector_node/ball_cordinate` |
| Komunikasi | Ada (robotinfo, from_udp_to_ros) | Tidak ada |
| RobotInfo | Ada (RobotInfo_Callback) | Tidak ada |
| Taskcom | Ada broadcast ke UDP | Tidak ada |
| HEADING_TO_GOAL | 2 tahap (first + second) | 1 tahap langsung ke positioning |
| Kick action | 225/230 (langsung) | 176-183 (sequential) |
| yaw handling | Filter anti-loncat 179° | Langsung, tanpa filter |

## 5.2 Status Lifecycle

```python
INITIAL → READY → STANDBY → STOP
               ↘ RUN (langsung dari READY)
                    ↕ (toggle via button start)
               PRE_STOP

Catatan: Tidak ada PRE_POSITIONING_KICKOFF
         STATE_READY → langsung RUN, Task = "Positioning"
```

## 5.3 Task Flow

```
initial (2 siklus × 1000ms)
  ↓
follow_ball (tilt < -50 → heading_to_goal_first)
  ↓
heading_to_goal_first (yaw ±15° → heading_to_goal_second)
  ↓
heading_to_goal_second (walk_ball_positioning_to_goal)
  ↓                        (atau yaw ±5° → positioning_kick)
positioning_kick (walk_ball_position_to_kick)
  ↓
kick_ball (action 176-183)
  ↓
initial (loop)
```

## 5.4 Parameters Berbeda

```python
walk_follow_head:
  a_move_max = 15.0
  x_move_max = 30.0 (vs 20.0 di process.py)
  tilt_min = -50 (vs -61 di process.py)

positioning_kick condition:
  (delta_pan < 4 and delta_tilt < 4) or ball_size > 3000
  (vs delta_pan > -2 dan < 2, delta_tilt < 13, ball_size > 4000)

kick_ball action:
  ball_x_angle < 0: action 180,181,182,183 (sequential)
  ball_x_angle > 0: action 176,177,178,179 (sequential)
```

## 5.5 Head Control yang Berbeda

```python
# process_baru.py panggil Motion_HeadControl langsung
Motion_HeadControl(0.0, -0.20)  # Setelah kick
# vs process.py yang set headTilt dulu
```

