---

## 18.4 Istilah Penting (Glossary)

| Istilah | Arti |
|---|---|
| FK / Forward Kinematics | Perhitungan posisi kaki dari sudut joint |
| Dead-Reckoning | Estimasi posisi tanpa referensi eksternal |
| Phase | Fase walking (0/1/2/3 = foot touch/swap/lift) |
| DSP | Double Support Phase (2 kaki di tanah) |
| SSP | Single Support Phase (1 kaki di tanah) |
| Action Page | Gerakan pre-programmed (kick, getup) |
| Gait | Pola jalan |
| Yaw | Sudut orientasi robot (kompas) |
| Pitch | Sudut kemiringan depan-belakang |
| Pan | Gerakan head horizontal (kiri-kanan) |
| Tilt | Gerakan head vertikal (atas-bawah) |
| Taskcom | Task code yang di-share antar robot via UDP |
| Initpoint | Posisi awal robot di lapangan |
| Gate Counter | Counter untuk mencegah multiple trigger state |

